                <p>Non-personally identifiable or aggregate information may be used by us for any purposes permitted by law and may be shared with any number of parties, provided that such information shall not specifically identify you.</p>
                <h2><strong>How We Disclosure Information We Collect</strong></h2>
                <p>We will only share or disclose your personally identifiable information as described below unless you have specifically consented to another type of disclosure:</p>
